# pnpm's own settings are not read from here. As of pnpm 11 they live in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, and a setting written in this file is silently ignored —
# which is how autoInstallPeers came back on and put a second react under
# packages/core. See the comment above `autoInstallPeers` there.
#
# This file is kept as the signpost, because pnpm-workspace.yaml is not where
# anyone looks first.
